{"id": "treasurer-contract-steering", "title": "Audit: Treasurer's deputy steered a $7M tax-system contract to a friend's firm", "seconds": 136.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "b3b69a12e92b6ae4", "words": 430, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "San Francisco’s tax office needed a new computer system for business taxes.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.62, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Treasurer & Tax Collector", "sub": "replacing an old business tax system"}, "wt": [0.08, 0.15, 0.75, 0.95, 1.28, 1.54, 1.62, 1.81, 2.15, 2.47, 2.6, 2.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "So it asked companies to bid.", "t0": 3.74, "t1": 5.03, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Treasurer & Tax Collector", "sub": "replacing an old business tax system"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.22, 0.42, 0.81, 0.92]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["amount", "established[5]"], "text": "How much was the contract worth?", "t0": 5.15, "t1": 6.66, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "The contract", "sub": "never signed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.33, 0.46, 0.61, 1.07]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[5]"], "text": "7 million dollars.", "t0": 6.66, "t1": 8.31, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$7 million", "label": "business-tax-system contract", "sub": "later negotiated to $10 million, never signed"}, "emph": ["7"], "wt": [0.04, 0.69, 1.03]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2026, the Controller and City Attorney audited it. It found steering.", "t0": 8.83, "t1": 13.68, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "steered a $7 million contract to her friend’s company"}, "emph": ["steering"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.43, 0.64, 1.48, 1.58, 2.02, 2.12, 2.38, 2.78, 3.11, 3.6, 3.92, 4.25]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[4]"], "text": "It’s an official finding. The official disputes parts of it.", "t0": 13.8, "t1": 16.6, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "An official finding", "sub": "disputed in part by the former official"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.13, 0.54, 1.06, 1.24, 1.72, 2.23, 2.48, 2.57]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]", "story[0]"], "text": "The official was Tajel Shah, the Chief Assistant Treasurer.", "t0": 16.82, "t1": 19.73, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, "wt": [0.03, 0.12, 0.54, 0.81, 1.28, 1.69, 1.79, 2.04, 2.38]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The company was Mechanical Orchard. A close friend of hers was its chief revenue officer.", "t0": 19.85, "t1": 23.89, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "close family friends", "sub": "not disclosed in writing"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "its chief revenue officer"}], "kicker": "The friendship"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.48, 0.68, 1.21, 1.72, 1.91, 2.1, 2.32, 2.45, 2.64, 2.77, 2.92, 3.18, 3.52]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "She never disclosed that in writing.", "t0": 24.01, "t1": 25.58, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "close family friends", "sub": "not disclosed in writing"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "its chief revenue officer"}], "kicker": "The friendship"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.34, 0.85, 1.0, 1.13]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Why is that a concern?", "t0": 25.7, "t1": 26.68, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "close family friends", "sub": "not disclosed in writing"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "its chief revenue officer"}], "kicker": "The friendship"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.21, 0.35, 0.44]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Office policy required it in writing, so the Treasurer could take her off the decision.", "t0": 26.68, "t1": 30.42, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "close family friends", "sub": "not disclosed in writing"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "its chief revenue officer"}], "kicker": "The friendship"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.73, 1.1, 1.42, 1.51, 1.64, 2.11, 2.22, 2.31, 2.7, 2.89, 3.02, 3.12, 3.28, 3.38]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Nobody stepped in.", "t0": 30.54, "t1": 31.46, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tajel Shah", "sub": "Chief Assistant Treasurer"}, {"art": "question", "name": "close family friends", "sub": "not disclosed in writing"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "its chief revenue officer"}], "kicker": "The friendship"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.72]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[8]"], "text": "The first finding is a small job.", "t0": 31.68, "t1": 33.28, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A discovery project", "kicker": "The first finding", "sub": "2023, no competition", "chip": "$65,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.34, 0.67, 0.79, 0.87, 1.19]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[8]"], "text": "In 2023, the office paid the company to scope out the project. How much?", "t0": 33.4, "t1": 37.98, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A discovery project", "kicker": "The first finding", "sub": "2023, no competition", "chip": "$65,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.36, 1.22, 1.36, 1.64, 1.87, 1.96, 2.3, 2.43, 2.69, 2.8, 2.91, 3.55, 3.92]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "65,000 dollars.", "t0": 37.98, "t1": 39.55, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$65,000", "label": "for the 2023 discovery project", "sub": "through 21Tech’s existing sole-source contract"}, "emph": ["65,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.72, 1.06]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "story[1]"], "text": "No bidding. It was tacked onto 21Tech’s sole-source contract, a deal with one supplier and no bidding.", "t0": 40.07, "t1": 45.78, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "Tax office", "sub": "no bidding"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "21Tech", "sub": "existing sole-source contract"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Mechanical Orchard", "sub": "added as a subcontractor"}], "kicker": "The first finding"}, "emph": ["sole-source"], "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.65, 0.84, 1.02, 1.32, 1.79, 2.3, 2.78, 3.57, 3.66, 3.9, 4.06, 4.27, 4.82, 5.12, 5.25]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The results weren’t shared. So the firm that scoped the job then bid on it, knowing more.", "t0": 45.9, "t1": 50.09, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "holding information its rivals did not have"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.5, 0.78, 1.28, 1.48, 1.58, 1.82, 1.98, 2.34, 2.48, 2.77, 2.98, 3.17, 3.28, 3.5, 3.85]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]", "established[7]"], "text": "The second finding is a job.", "t0": 50.31, "t1": 51.93, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-03-22", "to": "2024-05-31", "days": "70", "fromLab": "relative hired", "toLab": "job ended", "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.35, 0.79, 1.0, 1.15]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[6]", "established[7]"], "text": "In January 2024, before the bid, she asked about work for a relative.", "t0": 52.05, "t1": 56.37, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-03-22", "to": "2024-05-31", "days": "70", "fromLab": "relative hired", "toLab": "job ended", "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.56, 0.82, 1.56, 1.8, 1.94, 2.57, 2.75, 2.95, 3.17, 3.42, 3.55, 3.65]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "One firm on the scoping job, Ratio PBC,", "t0": 56.49, "t1": 59.01, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-03-22", "to": "2024-05-31", "days": "70", "fromLab": "relative hired", "toLab": "job ended", "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.36, 0.42, 0.51, 0.87, 1.33, 1.77]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "says it hired the relative from March 22 to May 31, 2024.", "t0": 59.01, "t1": 62.96, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2024-03-22", "to": "2024-05-31", "days": "70", "fromLab": "relative hired", "toLab": "job ended", "kicker": "The second finding"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.32, 0.56, 0.66, 1.04, 1.18, 1.38, 2.01, 2.2, 2.38, 3.1, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[7]"], "text": "Auditors called it the appearance of a quid pro quo: a favor for work.", "t0": 63.08, "t1": 67.02, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the appearance of a quid pro quo"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.62, 0.73, 0.82, 1.31, 1.48, 1.56, 1.84, 2.13, 2.64, 2.85, 3.25, 3.52]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "established[7]"], "text": "Asking didn’t break City law back then.", "t0": 67.14, "t1": 68.96, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the appearance of a quid pro quo"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.7, 0.85, 1.08, 1.32, 1.53]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "The third finding: every bidder must meet five minimum requirements. On her orders, staff didn’t check.", "t0": 69.18, "t1": 74.51, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Minimum qualifications", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "five, never verified"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.07, 0.34, 0.86, 1.25, 1.58, 1.78, 2.01, 2.32, 2.72, 3.46, 3.66, 3.82, 4.35, 4.67, 5.03]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Mechanical Orchard missed one. It shouldn’t have been scored at all.", "t0": 74.63, "t1": 77.79, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Minimum qualifications", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "Mechanical Orchard missed one"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.88, 1.17, 1.57, 1.76, 1.97, 2.09, 2.2, 2.5, 2.63]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "story[2]"], "text": "The fourth finding is the biggest.", "t0": 78.01, "t1": 79.4, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Price score, before the change", "rows": [["Vynyl", "1"], ["Mechanical Orchard", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.34, 0.68, 0.79, 0.89]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "story[2]"], "text": "In October 2024, staff said Vynyl was the clear winner. Where was Mechanical Orchard?", "t0": 79.52, "t1": 84.66, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Price score, before the change", "rows": [["Vynyl", "1"], ["Mechanical Orchard", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.42, 0.68, 1.5, 1.76, 2.02, 2.37, 2.53, 2.63, 2.89, 3.45, 3.82, 3.95, 4.37]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[3]"], "text": "Fourth.", "t0": 84.66, "t1": 85.31, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "4th", "label": "Mechanical Orchard’s place"}, "emph": ["Fourth"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what"], "text": "Then she had staff add hidden costs to each rival. How much?", "t0": 85.83, "t1": 89.48, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["added to each rival", "$1.735 million"], "b": ["added to Mechanical Orchard", "$116,000"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.29, 0.46, 0.84, 1.02, 1.26, 1.61, 1.7, 1.91, 2.62, 3.19]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "established[3]"], "text": "1.735 million dollars.", "t0": 89.48, "t1": 92.48, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1.735 million", "label": "added to each competitor", "sub": "Mechanical Orchard got $116,000"}, "emph": ["1.735"], "wt": [0.04, 0.6, 0.92, 1.2, 1.53, 1.81, 2.33]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what"], "text": "575,000 for hosting, 1.16 million for staff.", "t0": 93.0, "t1": 97.21, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["hosting", "$575,000"], "b": ["IT staffing", "$1.16 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.84, 1.17, 1.33, 2.23, 2.4, 2.77, 2.93, 3.18, 3.57, 3.73]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what"], "text": "Mechanical Orchard got only 116,000. Auditors couldn’t back up the costs.", "t0": 97.33, "t1": 102.02, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["hosting", "$575,000"], "b": ["IT staffing", "$1.16 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.82, 1.06, 1.27, 1.45, 1.74, 2.2, 3.05, 3.5, 3.72, 3.93, 4.05, 4.22]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "And the result? Mechanical Orchard jumped from fourth place to first.", "t0": 102.14, "t1": 105.54, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "After the change", "rows": [["Mechanical Orchard", "1"], ["Vynyl", "2"]]}, "emph": ["first"], "wt": [0.0, 0.01, 0.13, 0.74, 1.26, 1.59, 1.85, 2.0, 2.34, 2.69, 2.89]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "story[2]"], "text": "Vynyl protested. Shah denied it, without disclosing the added costs.", "t0": 105.66, "t1": 109.28, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "the protest that might have caught it went nowhere"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.3, 1.15, 1.47, 1.8, 2.05, 2.33, 2.78, 2.92, 3.16]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Here’s the twist. Nothing was signed.", "t0": 109.5, "t1": 111.34, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Never signed", "sub": "the company withdrew in September 2025"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.15, 0.26, 0.78, 1.2, 1.36]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The company pulled out in September 2025, a day before the claims went public.", "t0": 111.46, "t1": 115.77, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Never signed", "sub": "the company withdrew in September 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.41, 0.68, 0.82, 0.95, 1.34, 1.55, 2.48, 2.58, 2.81, 3.06, 3.17, 3.54, 3.7]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "So one City rule on signing wasn’t broken, because nothing was signed. Office policy was.", "t0": 115.89, "t1": 120.67, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "a clear violation of office policy"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.49, 0.75, 0.95, 1.08, 1.41, 1.7, 2.21, 2.48, 2.81, 2.95, 3.44, 3.88, 4.36]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[3]"], "text": "There’s no charge, no ethics penalty, and no finding she got money or gifts.", "t0": 120.79, "t1": 124.69, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any criminal charge or ethics penalty", "That Shah received money or gifts"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.36, 1.01, 1.14, 1.42, 2.0, 2.14, 2.28, 2.62, 2.8, 2.96, 3.28, 3.43]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? Any Ethics Commission case, and the score sheets before and after the change.", "t0": 124.81, "t1": 129.54, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Any Ethics Commission complaint or penalty"}, {"who": "", "what": "The score sheets before and after October 25 to 30, 2024"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.27, 0.6, 0.83, 1.13, 1.45, 1.88, 2.43, 2.5, 2.6, 2.87, 3.21, 3.62, 3.86, 4.12, 4.28]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "established[10]"], "text": "The office accepted all eight recommendations. It’s cancelling the bid and starting over.", "t0": 129.66, "t1": 133.93, "shot": "b28", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.42, 0.92, 1.07, 1.34, 2.21, 2.49, 2.82, 3.01, 3.32, 3.56, 3.91]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 134.05, "t1": 136.0, "shot": "b29", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.59, 0.71, 0.9, 0.97, 1.07, 1.32, 1.54]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Finding 1 · $65,000, no bidding", "lead2": "Finding 2 · a job for a relative", "lead3": "Finding 3 · the unchecked gate", "lead4": "Finding 4 · fourth to first", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "person"}